{"mode":"words","text":"Vanaf hier bepaalt jouw leerdoel wat je doet. Wil je de taal alleen maar begrijpen, dan heb je je doel nu al bereikt — blijf gewoon bij stap twee en drie. Wil je spreken, dan komt het meespreken aan bod: neem met de A-B-herhaling een korte zin, zet de snelheid heel langzaam en spreek tegelijkertijd mee met de stem — net als in een koor. Je hoort meteen als iets anders klinkt en corrigeert jezelf vanzelf. Dat kan overal, zelfs in de tram: met een koptelefoon klinkt het als een telefoongesprek. En als je wilt leren schrijven, schrijf de tekst dan gewoon zin voor zin mee.","words":[{"s":0,"e":290},{"s":372,"e":662},{"s":755,"e":1091},{"s":1173,"e":1277},{"s":1335,"e":1707},{"s":1776,"e":1916},{"s":1974,"e":2032},{"s":2078,"e":2473},{"s":3077,"e":3262},{"s":3320,"e":3367},{"s":3402,"e":3471},{"s":3529,"e":3913},{"s":4122,"e":4470},{"s":4505,"e":4621},{"s":4667,"e":5468},{"s":5642,"e":5759},{"s":5793,"e":5886},{"s":5956,"e":6014},{"s":6060,"e":6130},{"s":6177,"e":6374},{"s":6444,"e":6571},{"s":6641,"e":6734},{"s":6780,"e":7210},{"s":7245,"e":7303},{"s":7349,"e":7616},{"s":7651,"e":8057},{"s":8150,"e":8266},{"s":8301,"e":8487},{"s":8545,"e":8731},{"s":8766,"e":8824},{"s":8859,"e":9242},{"s":9683,"e":9846},{"s":9904,"e":9950},{"s":9985,"e":10635},{"s":10786,"e":10902},{"s":10925,"e":11134},{"s":11157,"e":11239},{"s":11285,"e":11877},{"s":11912,"e":12017},{"s":12063,"e":12551},{"s":12934,"e":13143},{"s":13189,"e":13317},{"s":13340,"e":13387},{"s":13479,"e":14443},{"s":14501,"e":14571},{"s":14617,"e":14861},{"s":14896,"e":15372},{"s":15697,"e":15906},{"s":15941,"e":15987},{"s":16034,"e":16545},{"s":16591,"e":16742},{"s":16800,"e":17357},{"s":17798,"e":17938},{"s":17973,"e":18228},{"s":18274,"e":18925},{"s":18971,"e":19122},{"s":19157,"e":19284},{"s":19308,"e":19366},{"s":19412,"e":19726},{"s":19900,"e":20016},{"s":20399,"e":20631},{"s":20701,"e":20805},{"s":20863,"e":20945},{"s":20991,"e":21061},{"s":21142,"e":21665},{"s":21908,"e":22001},{"s":22059,"